      "text": "[9:21p.m.] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in and out of Apongbon is good.\nDescending the CMS Bridge to Apongbon is also good.\n\nAscending the Eko Bridge through Offin Canal and the Market to Costain is all good.\n\nOur Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is unhindered.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@HeroPrince_21 \n@tobiidowu_ \n@Gidi_Traffic",
